(6785662, 1019158, 124815, '<td valign="top">Wonderful picture - seems like you started with the idea and then found a perfect image to accompany it. I am going from one square to the other and each one has its own life and story to tell.</td>', 'Wonderful picture - seems like you started with the idea and then found a perfect image to accompany it. I am going from one square to the other and each one has its own life and story to tell.', '2012-06-04 12:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
