(6785705, 1019009, 83313, '<td valign="top">How is this abstract? A nicely composed scene (I might have cropped a bit more off the bottom, but that''s personal preference) but I can''t see how this is abstract by any stretch of the definition. Sorry.</td>', 'How is this abstract? A nicely composed scene (I might have cropped a bit more off the bottom, but that''s personal preference) but I can''t see how this is abstract by any stretch of the definition. Sorry.', '2012-06-04 13:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6785710, 1019173, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice textures and tones to this. Quite appealing.</td>', 'Nice textures and tones to this. Quite appealing.', '2012-06-04 13:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6785712, 1018531, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m having a tough time with this one. Does not fit my understanding of abstract, though I can see how you think it might fit. So I am asking myself, if it is primarily about the shapes and textures rather than the subject. My response to myself is that it is a photo of a pretty woman that tells me a story of her past love. Sorry.</td>', 'I''m having a tough time with this one. Does not fit my understanding of abstract, though I can see how you think it might fit. So I am asking myself, if it is primarily about the shapes and textures rather than the subject. My response to myself is that it is a photo of a pretty woman that tells me a story of her past love. Sorry.', '2012-06-04 13:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
