(6792188, 1018899, 92953, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> So intriguing<br/> <br/>I''m hanging this in my fantasy art gallery.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/artpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/artpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/artpost.jpg"/> </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you so much to be in the FA gallery. The image of a motorbike. The eldest sister carries 3 young sibling after school. 4 persons into a bike was illegal but no rules prohibited those on rural unpave road.<br/> <br/>And thanks so much averyone for the comments and votes. Much apprieciated. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-06-11 03:36:19.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: So intriguing I''m hanging this in my fantasy art gallery.    Thank you so much to be in the FA gallery. The image of a motorbike. The eldest sister carries 3 young sibling after school. 4 persons into a bike was illegal but no rules prohibited those on rural unpave road. And thanks so much averyone for the comments and votes. Much apprieciated. ', '2012-06-11 04:32:51.000000', '2012-06-11 04:36:19.000000', 0),
