(6797802, 1018378, 86447, '<td valign="top">Not for me...   It''s obvious that this is a photo of a bird.   There is not thought process that takes me there.  It''s instantaneous.<br/> <br/>For an abstract, one''s brain, I think, has to work to put the pieces together.<br/> <br/>But, it''s a lovely photo of a bird.  :D<br/></td>', 'Not for me...   It''s obvious that this is a photo of a bird.   There is not thought process that takes me there.  It''s instantaneous. For an abstract, one''s brain, I think, has to work to put the pieces together. But, it''s a lovely photo of a bird.  :D', '2012-06-18 23:22:03.000000', NULL, 0),
