(6831130, 1019168, 129807, '<td valign="top">I do actually like this image. It is beautiful in it''s simplicity. I ''want'' to give it a bit more space on the left and bottom, a very little less space at the top. The manner in which the table edge (?) disappears on the left is a little disconcerting. Overall it is a minimal image with oodles of character and expression. Potentially ''not abstract enough'' for this challenge.</td>', 'I do actually like this image. It is beautiful in it''s simplicity. I ''want'' to give it a bit more space on the left and bottom, a very little less space at the top. The manner in which the table edge (?) disappears on the left is a little disconcerting. Overall it is a minimal image with oodles of character and expression. Potentially ''not abstract enough'' for this challenge.', '2012-07-31 00:37:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(6831146, 1019168, 10848, '<td valign="top">I personally like this, the high key element and the clean lines, very contemporary, would make a great print!</td>', 'I personally like this, the high key element and the clean lines, very contemporary, would make a great print!', '2012-07-31 01:18:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(6831268, 1019168, 67152, '<td valign="top">i find this one very satisfying, especially the softness of the image itself, both the light and the lack of over sharpening from post processing.  i just am wondering what happened to the shadow on the table to the left of the vase...it gives it an almost unbalanced feel.</td>', 'i find this one very satisfying, especially the softness of the image itself, both the light and the lack of over sharpening from post processing.  i just am wondering what happened to the shadow on the table to the left of the vase...it gives it an almost unbalanced feel.', '2012-07-31 06:47:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(6831323, 1019168, 119012, '<td valign="top">nice, i wish it was just a tad lower on the exposure, however it has a whispy feel and i love the simplicity</td>', 'nice, i wish it was just a tad lower on the exposure, however it has a whispy feel and i love the simplicity', '2012-07-31 09:03:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(6831336, 1019168, 55822, '<td valign="top">Great simple image that while doesn''t meet my idea of abstract I can see where you were going with it. The contrast of the branches against the vase for me is what makes this such a strong image.</td>', 'Great simple image that while doesn''t meet my idea of abstract I can see where you were going with it. The contrast of the branches against the vase for me is what makes this such a strong image.', '2012-07-31 09:33:18.000000', NULL, 0),
